OL,3,GNEWSAFan's surprise wedding proposal at
OL,4,AMichael Jackson tribute show           
OL,6,FBescoby, 46, from Worksop in           
OL,7,FNottinghamshire, said yes, much to the 
OL,8,Frelief of her partner and the delight  
OL,9,Fof the packed theatre.                 
